{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"928","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Login Verification"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When registering in a social network, users are allowed to create their own convenient login to make it easier to share contacts, print it on business cards, etc."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Login is an arbitrary sequence of lower and uppercase latin letters, digits and underline symbols («"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"_"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"»). However, in order to decrease the number of frauds and user-inattention related issues, it is prohibited to register a login if it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" with an already existing login. More precisely, two logins "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" are considered similar if we can transform "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" via a sequence of operations of the following types: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" transform lowercase letters to uppercase and vice versa; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" change letter «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (uppercase latin letter) to digit «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» and vice versa; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" change digit «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (one) to any letter among «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (lowercase latin «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"L"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"»), «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (uppercase latin «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"») and vice versa, or change one of these letters to other. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, logins «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» and «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codef0rces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» as well as «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"OO0OOO00O0OOO0O00OOO0OO_lol"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» and «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"OO0OOO0O00OOO0O00OO0OOO_1oI"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» are considered similar whereas «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» and «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Code_forces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You're given a list of existing logins with no two "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" amonst and a newly created user login. Check whether this new login is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" with any of the existing ones."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a non-empty string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of lower and uppercase latin letters, digits and underline symbols («"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"_"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"») with length not exceeding "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"50"},{"kind":"text","text":"  — the login itself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 1 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of existing logins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe the existing logins, following the same constraints as the user login (refer to the first line of the input). It's guaranteed that no two existing logins are similar."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (without quotes), if user can register via this login, i.e. none of the existing logins is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"similar"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" with it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise print «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs